^[[36;1m  outcome='**miss** -- every dependency will be recompiled'^[[0m
^[[36;1mfi^[[0m
^[[36;1mif [ "${RESTORE_ONLY}" = 'true' ]; then mode='restore-only'; else mode='read-write'; fi^[[0m
